  id: Forest_Cabin_3
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 3"
  content: "\tThe silence around the house deepens each day. The animals are almost
    all gone \u2014 the few that remain can be counted on one hand. Something is
    coming, and they know it long before we do. They always have.\n\r\n\tBut where
    did they go? And where am I supposed to go?"
